By installing, accessing or using WorkManager, you agree to this Agreement. If you do not agree, do not install or use the software.

1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the WorkManager application, including its source code, documentation, database schema, and any updates Licensor provides.

"Installation" means one deployment of the Software that serves one company, using the database and hosting accounts that Licensee controls.

"Authorised User" means an employee, contractor or team member of Licensee who signs in to an Installation under Licensee's control.

"Licensee Data" means all information Licensee and its Authorised Users enter into, store in, or generate with the Software, including clients, projects, tasks, documents, payments, expenses and files.

