Subject to this Agreement and payment of applicable fees, Licensor grants Licensee a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable licence to:

(a) install and run one Installation of the Software for Licensee's own internal business use; and

(b) allow Authorised Users to use that Installation for that purpose.

The licence covers the number of Installations and Authorised Users stated in the order form or invoice. Additional Installations or users require an additional licence.

